          {"option_id": "B", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "先把 x^2 换成 x，再把移项写成 3y=x-1；取 x=1,-1 得 y=0,-2/3；第二对原式为 -1。", "misconception": "同时丢掉平方并反向移项。"},
          {"option_id": "C", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "$1^2+3\\cdot0=1$，$(-1)^2+3\\cdot0=1$。", "misconception": null},
          {"option_id": "D", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "从 3y=1-x^2 错得 y=3(1-x^2)，取 x=0,1 得 y=3,0；第一对原式为 9。", "misconception": "分离 y 时把除以 3 换成乘以 3。"}
        ]
      }
    },
    {
